<h2 class="bold" id="js-module-reference"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="block-action#js-module-reference">JS module reference</a></h2>
<p>Javascript is required when using an Indicator element.</p>
<p>All elements with <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">[data-block-action]</span></span></code></span> attribute are initialized automatically.</p>
